        "details": "Hosts accept no caller-supplied action id. Every governed mutation is      callable only by the immutable authority and independently verifies      the six-return in-flight action context before writing. The executor      owns action-id derivation; hosts own the exact action class and per-call      scope/old/new state commitments.",
